{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50240","headline":"秦筝怨（伯三八八五） · 宋家娘子","name":"秦筝怨（伯三八八五）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玳瑁秦筝里，声声怨别离。\n只缘多苦调，欲奏泪还垂。\n妾意如弦直，君心学柱移。\n蹔时停不弄，音调早参差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋家娘子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}